Z||000002||WampusCat||11-09-2001||06:25 PM||||When I was attached to 3rd Tank Bn, we had a family day/picknic where the main entertainment was a drawing to see which M1 driver got to run over a car  donated by a local salvage yard.  I guess I was expecting the tank to climb over the car like a monster truck does but it didn't look like that at all.  The tank just rolled straight ahead like it was on smooth pavement and the car just dissapeared beneath the treads and became a sheet metal pancake.  Don't argue with someone in a 136,000 pound vehicle.||||reg||1
